                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1977–1980, Volume I, Foundations of Foreign Policy. Please
                    be aware that printed volumes have not been revised. </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>1. <ref target="#pg612">Footnote 3, Document 120, Page 612</ref>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">(date of correction: December 3, 2020)</hi></item>
                    <item>The volume number is incorrect. It was changed from “vol. XVI” to “vol.
                        XIV.”</item>
                    <!-- <item>Update this section with correct cross reference information from AID
                        78-80 in footnotes in documents 95, 96, and 147.</item> -->
                </list>
            </div>
